  "Press-side color measurement with single-click operation — strict color-deviation control with less manual error.": "機邊色彩量測，單鍵操作 —— 嚴格控管色差，減少人為誤差。",
  "See Sustainability in Action": "親眼看見永續如何運作",
  "NTI’s factory is built around environmental care and employee well-being. Our modern, fully air-conditioned office and production facility has been designed to provide a safe, clean and inspiring workplace for every member of our team.": "NTI 的廠房以環境照護與員工福祉為核心而建。現代化、全廠空調的辦公室與生產設施，是為了給每一位同仁安全、整潔且能激發靈感的工作環境而設計。",
  "Visitors can explore our clean water treatment system, energy-efficient production lines, and green facilities designed for both people and the planet.": "來訪者可以參觀我們的淨水處理系統、節能生產線，以及同時為人與地球著想的綠色設施。",
  "Book a guided tour and experience how we bring ‘The Courage to Print Green’ to life.": "預約導覽，親身體驗我們如何實踐「勇於印綠」。",
  "FAQ — NTI Printing": "常見問題 —— NTI Printing",
  "FAQ categories": "問題分類",
  "Your questions answered": "您的問題，我們來回答",
  "Find answers to common questions about green printing, packaging, certifications, sustainability, and working with NTI.": "關於綠色印刷、包裝、認證、永續，以及與 NTI 合作的常見問題解答。",
  "All questions": "全部問題",
  "Services & Process": "服務與流程",
  "International": "國際業務",
  "What is your minimum order quantity?": "最小訂購量是多少？",
  "It depends on the process. Offset color boxes typically start around 1,000 units; short-run and pilot production can go lower on our digital and UV lines. Tell us the quantity you actually need — we will spec the most economical route rather than force a minimum.": "視製程而定。平版彩盒通常自 1,000 個起；少量與試產可在數位與 UV 產線上做到更低。告訴我們您實際需要的數量 —— 我們會規劃最經濟的做法，而不是硬塞一個最低量。",
  "Can you handle food-grade and pharma packaging requirements?": "你們能處理食品級與醫藥包裝的要求嗎？",
  "Yes. We run migration-safe, low-odor ink systems for food contact, and GMP-aligned inspection with batch traceability for pharmaceutical cartons. Compliance documentation is prepared together with the job.": "可以。食品接觸我們使用低遷移、低氣味的油墨系統；藥品彩盒則採符合 GMP 精神的檢驗與批次追溯。合規文件會與訂單一併準備。",
  "What files do you need to start a quote?": "報價需要提供哪些檔案？",
  "A dieline (AI/PDF) if you have one, artwork in PDF/X, and your target quantity, board and finish. No dieline yet? Send product dimensions and we will propose a structure.": "若已有刀模圖請提供（AI／PDF）、PDF/X 格式的完稿，以及目標數量、紙材與加工方式。還沒有刀模圖？把產品尺寸寄來，我們會提出結構建議。",
  "How do you calculate the carbon footprint of my order?": "你們如何計算我這筆訂單的碳足跡？",
  "We meter energy, board, ink and waste at each production stage against our audited baseline, then allocate to your order by run. You receive a per-order figure your ESG team can cite, with methodology notes.": "我們在每個生產階段量測能源、紙材、油墨與廢棄物，對照經稽核的基準線，再依批次分攤到您的訂單。您會拿到一份可供 ESG 團隊引用的每單數字，並附方法說明。",
  "Which eco materials can you print on?": "你們可以印在哪些環保材料上？",
  "FSC™-certified virgin and recycled boards, kraft, and specialty recycled stocks. We replace plastic lamination with recyclable coatings wherever the spec allows.": "FSC™ 認證的原生與再生紙板、牛皮紙，以及特殊再生紙材。只要規格允許，我們會以可回收塗層取代塑膠貼合。",
  "What are typical lead times?": "一般交期多久？",
  "Standard color box orders run 10–15 working days from artwork approval; repeat orders are faster. Complex finishing adds time — we commit dates from real machine capacity, and keep them.": "標準彩盒訂單自完稿確認起 10–15 個工作天；重複訂單更快。複雜加工會增加時間 —— 我們依實際機台產能承諾日期，並且守住它。",
  "Do you support structural design and prototyping?": "你們提供結構設計與打樣嗎？",
  "Yes. Our pre-press team provides dielines, white samples and printed mockups, plus drop and transit testing for shipping structures before mass production.": "提供。製版團隊會產出刀模圖、白樣與印刷樣，量產前也會針對運輸結構做落下與運輸測試。",
  "Can international clients work with you?": "國際客戶可以與你們合作嗎？",
  "Absolutely — a large share of our output ships to Japan, the EU and North America. We handle export cartons, documentation and freight coordination from the Tainan plant.": "當然 —— 我們有很大比例的產出銷往日本、歐盟與北美。出口外箱、文件與貨運協調都由台南廠處理。",
  "Didn’t find your answer?": "沒找到您的答案？",
  "Our team replies within one business day.": "我們的團隊會在一個工作日內回覆。",
  "Get a Quote — NTI Printing": "索取報價 —— NTI Printing",
  "e.g. 10,000": "例如 10,000",
  "e.g. 220 × 160 × 60": "例如 220 × 160 × 60",
  "What must this package do? Food contact, export market, shelf finish, compliance…": "這個包裝必須做到什麼？食品接觸、出口市場、貨架質感、法規合規⋯⋯",
  "Tell us what the package must do. A packaging engineer — not a bot — replies within one business day with routes and rough numbers.": "告訴我們這個包裝必須做到什麼。回覆您的是包裝工程師，不是機器人，會在一個工作日內給出做法與初步數字。",
  "Send the brief — dieline optional": "把需求寄來 —— 刀模圖非必要",
  "We propose structure, material & process": "我們提出結構、材料與製程建議",
  "Quote with carbon estimate included": "報價含碳排估算",
  "Request received": "需求已收到",
  "Thank you — our team will reply within one business day. A copy of your request has been sent to your email.": "感謝您 —— 我們的團隊會在一個工作日內回覆。需求副本已寄到您的信箱。",
  "Submit another request": "再送出一筆需求",
