  "— Through action, not words.": "—— 用行動，不是用說的。",
  "Quality Management": "品質管理",
  "FSC, ISO 14001, CO2 Neutral, Green Printing, Green Building (Diamond), Mineral Oil Free": "FSC、ISO 14001、碳中和、綠色印刷、綠建築（鑽石級）、無礦物油",
  "Social Responsibility & Safety": "社會責任與安全",
  "Our Clients": "我們的客戶",
  "Trusted by leading domestic and international brands.": "國內外領導品牌的信賴之選。",
  "Industry Trends — NTI Printing": "產業趨勢 —— NTI Printing",
  "Sustainable packaging industry trends: regulation, mono-material design, carbon data, short runs and traceability — read from the pressroom floor.": "永續包裝的產業趨勢：法規、單一材質設計、碳數據、少量印製與可追溯性 —— 從印刷現場看出去的觀察。",
  "Sustainable packaging industry trends": "永續包裝產業趨勢",
  "Where packaging is heading": "包裝正在往哪裡走",
  "What brand owners are asking us for, and what the regulations, materials and machines are about to make standard.": "品牌客戶正在向我們要求什麼，以及法規、材料與機台即將把哪些事變成標配。",
  "We sit between brand owners and the pressroom, so we see requirement changes early — usually a year or two before they land in a tender document. These are the shifts our customers are planning around right now.": "我們位在品牌客戶與印刷現場之間，因此很早就看到需求的變化 —— 通常比它出現在標案文件上早一到兩年。以下是我們的客戶現在正在據以規劃的轉變。",
  "Regulation is setting the pace": "法規正在定調節奏",
  "Packaging rules in the EU, Japan and North America are converging on recyclability, recycled content and disclosure. Design decisions that used to be aesthetic — a laminate, a foil, a window — are now compliance decisions.": "歐盟、日本與北美的包裝法規，正朝可回收性、再生料含量與資訊揭露收斂。過去屬於美感範疇的設計決定 —— 貼合膜、燙金、開窗 —— 現在都成了合規決定。",
  "Recyclability assessed at the pack level, not the material level.": "可回收性以「整個包裝」評估，而不是以單一材料評估。",
  "Recycled-content thresholds written into purchase specifications.": "再生料含量門檻被寫進採購規格。",
  "Carbon and material data requested as part of the quote, not after delivery.": "碳與材料數據在報價階段就要提供，而不是交貨之後才補。",
  "Mono-material replaces the composite pack": "單一材質取代複合結構",
  "Composite structures print beautifully and recycle badly. The move is toward one board, one coating, one waste stream — which pushes the burden onto printing and finishing to deliver the same shelf impact without plastic lamination.": "複合結構印起來漂亮，回收起來麻煩。趨勢是走向一種紙、一種塗層、一條廢棄物流 —— 這把壓力推回印刷與加工端：不靠塑膠貼合，也要做出同樣的貨架效果。",
  "Recyclable water-based coatings in place of PET/OPP lamination.": "以可回收的水性塗層取代 PET／OPP 貼合。",
  "Structural strength engineered through the dieline rather than added film.": "結構強度改由刀模設計來達成，而不是額外加膜。",
  "FSC™ virgin and recycled boards specified side by side in one range.": "FSC™ 原生紙板與再生紙板並列在同一個產品系列的規格中。",
  "Carbon data becomes a line item": "碳數據成為報價的一個項目",
  "Scope 3 reporting has turned the printed carton into a data point. Brands increasingly need a per-order figure their ESG team can cite — measured against an audited baseline, not estimated from an industry average.": "範疇三（Scope 3）盤查讓印刷彩盒變成一個數據點。品牌愈來愈需要一份 ESG 團隊能引用的每單數字 —— 對照經稽核的基準線量測，而不是用產業平均值推估。",
  "Per-order footprint reported with methodology notes.": "每筆訂單的碳足跡回報，並附方法說明。",
  "Energy, board, ink and waste metered by production stage.": "能源、紙材、油墨與廢棄物依生產階段計量。",
  "Supplier carbon performance weighted in vendor selection.": "供應商的碳表現被納入廠商評選的權重。",
  "Shorter runs, more versions": "批量更小，版本更多",
  "Product ranges are fragmenting into regional, seasonal and campaign variants. The economic run length keeps falling, which favours digital and variable-data workflows alongside offset rather than instead of it.": "產品線正在分化成區域版、季節版與活動版。經濟批量持續下降，這讓數位與可變資料流程與平版並存，而不是取代平版。",
  "Variable data and versioning handled without new plates.": "可變資料與多版本處理，不必重新製版。",
  "Hybrid routing — the same artwork quoted offset, digital or UV.": "混合路徑 —— 同一份完稿可分別以平版、數位或 UV 報價。",
  "Right-weighted inventory instead of over-printing to hit a price break.": "依實際需求備貨，而不是為了拿到價格級距而超印。",
  "Traceability from plate to pallet": "從印版到棧板的可追溯性",
  "Food-contact and pharmaceutical work has raised the bar for everyone. Batch traceability, migration-safe ink systems and inspection records are moving from regulated categories into mainstream retail packaging.": "食品接觸與醫藥類的要求把所有人的門檻都拉高了。批次追溯、低遷移油墨系統與檢驗紀錄，正從受管制的品類擴散到一般零售包裝。",
  "Batch records linking board lot, ink set and press run.": "批次紀錄串起紙材批號、油墨組與印刷批次。",
  "Low-migration, low-odour inks as a default rather than an upgrade.": "低遷移、低氣味油墨成為預設，而不是加價選項。",
  "Barcode, colour and rub testing logged per job.": "條碼、色彩與耐磨測試逐單留存紀錄。",
  "Planning against one of these shifts?": "正在為其中一項轉變做規劃嗎？",
  "Tell us the spec you are being asked to hit — we will tell you what it costs to print.": "告訴我們您被要求達到的規格 —— 我們會告訴您印出來要多少成本。",
