  "Where sustainable packaging is heading next": "永續包裝接下來要往哪裡走",
  "Speaking up for the leopard cat: NTI joins the Animals of Tomorrow exhibition — NTI Printing": "為石虎發聲：NTI 參與《明日動物》展覽 —— NTI Printing",
  "Speaking up for the leopard cat: NTI joins the Animals of Tomorrow exhibition": "為石虎發聲：NTI 參與《明日動物》展覽",
  "Exhibition": "展覽",
  "NTI joined 72 Design on the Animals of Tomorrow paper-model exhibition, supporting conservation of the Formosan black bear and the leopard cat through FSC-certified paper and HP Indigo digital printing.": "NTI 與 72 Design 共同參與《明日動物》紙模型展，以 FSC 認證紙材與 HP Indigo 數位印刷，支持台灣黑熊與石虎的保育。",
  "Life on paper, design with care": "紙上的生命，帶著關懷的設計",
  "The exhibition focuses on endangered species. NTI and 72 Design co-created interactive paper-model installations built around the Formosan black bear and the leopard cat, produced with variable printing and no plate-making — which in practice means a lower-carbon, lower-waste process, creative work that also teaches, and the flexibility of digital printing across small, varied runs.": "展覽聚焦瀕危物種。NTI 與 72 Design 共同創作以台灣黑熊與石虎為主題的互動紙模型裝置，採可變印刷、免製版 —— 在實務上意味著更低碳、更少廢棄的製程，兼具教育性的創作，以及數位印刷在少量多樣時的彈性。",
  "Details": "展覽資訊",
  "Venue.": "地點。",
  "SPACE MOOR, Keelung.": "基隆 SPACE MOOR。",
