  "4. Data Retention & Security": "四、資料保存與安全",
  "Placeholder copy — personal data is retained only as long as needed for the stated purpose or as required by law, stored on access-controlled systems hosted in Azure with encryption in transit and at rest.": "暫定內容 —— 個人資料僅在達成所述目的所需期間或法令要求期間內保存，存放於 Azure 上具存取控管的系統，並於傳輸與靜態儲存時加密。",
  "5. Your Rights": "五、您的權利",
