  "Paper hang tags & backcards for blister packages.": "泡殼包裝用的紙製吊卡與背卡。",
  "NTI Printing produces custom cardboard packaging and printed cardboard boxes for retail, industrial, and consumer applications, including:": "NTI Printing 生產零售、工業與消費性應用的客製化紙板包裝與印刷紙盒，包括：",
  "Custom-printed paper hang tags and blister back cards designed to enhance product presentation while providing clear product information and strong retail impact.": "客製印刷的紙製吊卡與泡殼背卡，在提升產品陳列質感的同時，清楚傳達產品資訊，強化貨架吸引力。",
  "Hand tools, hardware, electronic components, automotive parts, and a wide range of consumer products.": "手工具、五金、電子零件、汽車零件，以及各類消費性產品。",
  "Blister card packaging combines two printed paperboards with a clear plastic blister to provide secure product protection, excellent visibility, and strong retail presentation.": "泡殼卡包裝以兩片印刷紙板搭配透明泡殼，提供穩固的產品保護、良好的可視性與強烈的零售陳列效果。",
  "Electronics, electrical appliances, hardware and hand tools.": "電子、電器、五金與手工具。",
  "Multi-panel hang tags provide additional space for product information, branding, and multilingual content while maintaining a compact retail presentation.": "多摺頁吊卡提供更多空間放置產品資訊、品牌內容與多語文字，同時維持精簡的零售外觀。",
