  "Other Printing Services": "其他印刷服務",
  "Special Printing & finishing": "特殊印刷與加工",
  "Enhance your packaging with premium finishes including foil stamping, embossing, holographic effects, and anti-counterfeiting features. Our specialty printing and custom print finishing solutions add visual impact, strengthen brand perception, and provide enhanced product security.": "以燙金、壓凸、雷射光影與防偽等高階加工，讓包裝更出色。特殊印刷與客製化印後加工能增加視覺衝擊、強化品牌感受，並提升產品的防偽保護。",
  "Other products include, but are not limited to, calendars, envelopes, bags, mouse pads, manuals, etc.": "其他產品包括但不限於月曆、紙袋、提袋、滑鼠墊、說明書等。",
  "A daily-use publication that keeps your brand on the desk all year — festival gifting, corporate gifts and promotions.": "日常使用的出版品，讓品牌整年都在桌上 —— 適合節慶贈禮、企業贈品與促銷。",
  "Every industry.": "各行各業。",
  "Great graphic design or hot-foil embossing turns a tradition into a brand moment.": "出色的平面設計或燙金壓凸，能把一個傳統變成品牌時刻。",
  "Paper carriers that promote the product and lift the brand on the street.": "紙製提袋在推廣產品的同時，也把品牌帶上街頭。",
  "UV-printed for high colour saturation and long fade resistance.": "採 UV 印刷，色彩飽和度高、抗褪色時間長。",
  "Product manuals, spec sheets and catalogues — function, usage and precautions, clearly printed.": "產品說明書、規格表與型錄 —— 功能、使用方式與注意事項，清楚印出。",
  "UV Printing — NTI Printing": "UV 印刷 —— NTI Printing",
  "Special Printing": "特殊印刷",
  "Print on the materials ordinary ink can’t touch.": "在一般油墨印不上去的材質上印刷。",
  "UV printing delivers vibrant, durable graphics on plastics, metal foils, coated paperboards, and other non-absorbent materials. Its instant curing process speeds up production, improves print quality, and supports premium finishes, specialty coatings, and anti-counterfeiting applications — one reason NTI Printing is a trusted source for UV coating printing in Taiwan.": "UV 印刷能在塑膠、金屬箔、塗佈紙板等非吸收性材質上，呈現鮮豔而耐久的圖像。瞬間固化的製程加快生產、提升印刷品質，並支援高階加工、特殊塗層與防偽應用 —— 這也是 NTI Printing 成為台灣 UV 上光印刷可靠來源的原因之一。",
  "Lithographic printing cured instantly by UV — runs on plastics and glossy boards where ink will not air-dry: PE, PVC and PP films, metal foil and other non-absorbent materials. Post-press can start immediately, with no back-print, cutting production time and cost.": "以 UV 瞬間固化的平版印刷 —— 可在油墨無法自然乾燥的塑膠與亮面紙板上作業：PE、PVC 與 PP 膜、金屬箔等非吸收性材質。印後加工可立即開始，不會背印，縮短生產時間與成本。",
  "Food, electronics, pharma, beauty and luxury goods — face-mask boxes, 3C packaging, cookie boxes, medical supplies coffee boxes and more.": "食品、電子、醫藥、美妝與精品 —— 面膜盒、3C 包裝、餅乾盒、醫療用品、咖啡盒等。",
  "Foil embossing and logical-light embossment developed for anti-counterfeiting and standout product finishes.": "為防偽與突出的產品質感所開發的燙金壓凸與雷射光影壓紋。",
  "Food, electronics, pharma, beauty and luxury goods — face-mask boxes, 3C packaging, cookie boxes, medical supplies medical beauty packaging and more.": "食品、電子、醫藥、美妝與精品 —— 面膜盒、3C 包裝、餅乾盒、醫療用品、醫美包裝等。",
